and collect the nuts as fast as possible.\n\n-- Physics-based movement system. Move your hands to move your body. Push off of any surface to move in the opposite direction. \n\n-- Use the index triggers to grab any surface.\n\n-- Use the grip trigger to point and interact with your watch\n\n-- Use watch to change display refresh rate (72 or 90Hz) and adjust snap turn angle or enable smooth turning\n\n-- Use either thumbstick to rotate\n\n-- Arrow indicator on watch will point to nearest nut.\n\n-- Timer starts when first nut is collected.\n\nATTENTION! This is an early version. I'm still optimizing art and finishing up the level designs. Hope you enjoy it! Email granitetopgames@gmail dot com with any feedback or issues. Thanks!", "short_description": "Climb, collect, and explore from the eyes of a squirrel in this single-player platforming game. Let's get nuts!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.granitetopgames.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Granite Top Games", "support_website_url": "http://www.granitetopgames.com/", "website_url": "http://www.granitetopgames.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "528142316460358"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "9464413566941155"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974887_